(
  'IELTS Writing Task 2 Tips That Actually Raise Your Score',
  'Use practical IELTS Writing Task 2 tips for question types, Band 7 structure, time management, vocabulary, grammar, and feedback-driven practice.',
  'Use practical IELTS Writing Task 2 tips for question types, Band 7 structure, time management, vocabulary, grammar, and feedback-driven practice.',
